omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IH-uXLqHB7oQ7kNvwG1lyec&_nc_oc=AdpCfskhh2ehRSa6jXR96YqSy8hMqgWys2hKITprGxlrjBQ3zDt25n39hXZGoSLkG6c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9G8bGF5Mq-dAziWS8q0saIOJ6k9Jhu1Fz0uGjux-USNw&oe=6A3D47B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DotV2cLykwoQ7kNvwFPByix&_nc_oc=Ado2eN-Nlise_6xVc0_E7y58GBBrBuYzj-Nl5WQJEjDmdxRUrtp9YQlZHnbxZoHUXxo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af87FaMnd5wlxLZOssepEy87R_Gra2NytNYtZblXI_Z4NA&oe=6A3D4916"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dMTuX63JTL0Q7kNvwHaV8W8&_nc_oc=Adppl-NL5dK4r6UcilzDy4dMrqgExGLfj_8sEjfkRjUDogwKb3EktwzWKPu64q7B908&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9h52VZ--n85VntCUHVMe6AjnR2ah_EgVNOQjUMA1z_Ng&oe=6A3D5E37"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://